.body);\r\n    45\t    u.pkg = pm.find() ? pm.group(1) : \"\";\r\n    46\t    Matcher im = IMP.matcher(u.body);\r\n    47\t    while (im.find()) {\r\n    48\t      String r = im.group(1);\r\n    49\t      if (r.endsWith(\".*\")) continue;\r\n"]
